---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="PikoBuy Guides | QC Photos, Shipping & Ordering" description="Practical PikoBuy spreadsheet guidance for source links, QC photos, ordering and parcel submission.">
  <section class="page-intro article">
    <p class="eyebrow">GUIDES</p>
    <h1>Use a spreadsheet as research, not a promise</h1>
    <p>A product row should help you locate a source listing. Always check the current seller title, options, price and availability before creating an order.</p>
    <h2 id="qc">QC photos and warehouse inspection</h2>
    <p>Warehouse images help you compare the received item with the listing and your selected option. They do not establish authenticity, future durability or delivery outcomes. Document any concern through the agent’s support flow before parcel submission.</p>
    <h2 id="shipping">Order and shipping sequence</h2>
    <p>According to PikoBuy’s public guide, choose or paste a source listing, select the required specifications and make the first payment. When items reach the warehouse, review inspection photos, then select a shipping route, submit the parcel and pay international shipping. Tracking can appear after dispatch.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
